## Risk Model

A lab-defined risk model was implemented.

| Detection | Risk Score |
|---|---:|
| DET-002 | 20 |
| DET-006 | 35 |
| DET-003 | 30 |
| DET-004 | 30 |
| DET-005 | 40 |

Maximum simulated risk score:

```text
155
```

Risk severity thresholds:

| Score | Severity |
|---:|---|
| 0–29 | Low |
| 30–59 | Medium |
| 60–99 | High |
| 100+ | Critical |

These values are lab-defined and are not presented as an industry-standard risk model.

