## CORR-001

Created:

```text
CORR-001 — Multi-Stage Windows Attack Activity
```

Purpose:

> Correlate multiple validated Windows security detections occurring within the same investigation window to identify potential multi-stage attack activity.

Correlation threshold:

```text
Three or more distinct detection categories
```

The threshold reduces the likelihood that one isolated event is treated as a critical incident.

---

## Positive Validation

The controlled attack produced:

```text
DET-002
DET-006
DET-003
DET-004
DET-005
```

Five distinct detection categories were observed.

Because:

```text
5 >= 3
```

CORR-001 satisfied the correlation threshold.

**Positive Validation:** PASS

---

## Negative Validation

A narrow time window containing insufficient detection diversity was tested.

The correlation condition:

```text
detection_count >= 3
```

was not satisfied.

CORR-001 therefore returned no result.

**Negative Validation:** PASS

