## Analyst Interpretation

The sequence demonstrated how correlation changes the meaning of individual security events.

Viewed independently:

```text
Failed Authentication
Remote Administrative Access
PowerShell Execution
Scheduled Task Creation
Privileged Group Change
```

may each have legitimate administrative explanations.

Viewed together:

```text
Authentication Failure
        |
        v
Remote Access
        |
        v
Suspicious Execution
        |
        v
Persistence
        |
        v
Privilege Modification
```

the activity becomes substantially more significant.

